==English==
{{wp|Brazil (disambiguation)|Brazil}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|en|pt|Brazil}}, older spelling of {{m|pt|Brasil}}, from {{m|pt|brasil||brazilwood}}, originally ‘red like an ember’, from {{m|pt|brasa||ember}}, ultimately from {{der|en|gem-pro|*brasō||gleed, crackling coal}}, and {{m|pt|-il||-ile, -like, -y}} from {{der|en|la|-īlis||adjective suffix}}.

